WEBVTT

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:17.750
My past five years are all riding
on this practical exam.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:20.540
I can't help but feel nervous...!

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:26.420
But if I can just pass it,
then I'll have finally done it...

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:29.290
I'll be an alchemist!

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:05.420
When are you going to be back?

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:09.380
We don't have too much to transport,
so we should be back by dusk.

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:11.130
Be a good girl and wait for us, okay?

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:12.540
Well then, we're off!

00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:15.460
Take care!

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:29.580
What's taking them so long?

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:31.380
Sarasa!

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:35.500
What is it, mister head clerk?

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:36.880
The managers...

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:40.710
Your mother and father, they were
attacked by bandits at the pass!

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:01.830
Welcome, Sarasa!

00:03:02.210 --> 00:03:05.790
Starting today, you're a
member of our family here!

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:25.830
She's been like that the whole time...

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:30.170
She may be throwing herself at her studies
to try to forget her painful past.

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:33.500
It's her own way of avoiding reality.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:36.960
Still, there's nothing wrong with studying.

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:39.000
Let's simply keep on watching over her.

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:47.380
We have here an alchemist who once lived
at this institution, just like all of you.

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:51.420
She has come today to give
a donation to our orphanage.

00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:53.540
It's my pleasure to meet all of you.

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:58.580
It makes me terribly happy to be able to
help repay the place that raised me...

00:03:58.580 --> 00:03:59.420
Um...!

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:01.750
What is it, Sarasa?

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:05.880
Um, can I become an alchemist too?!

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:11.630
Yes, if you work hard.

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:15.250
And if I do, can I earn lots of money?

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:19.250
Well, they say that if you
become an alchemist,

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:22.290
then you have a
secure future ahead of you.

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:27.830
S-so then, I could have a shop
like my mom and dad?!

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:29.460
Of course.

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:31.330
But it's no simple matter, you know.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:35.880
In order to become an alchemist,
you first need to become certified.

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:37.380
Certified...

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:48.000
The Royal Alchemist Academy...

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:51.330
This is the only school in this nation

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:54.500
where you can become
certified as an alchemist.

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:56.790
The unique thing about this institution

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:59.920
is that anyone can be admitted here
if they put in the effort,

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:02.130
regardless of whether or not
they're a noble.

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:04.500
Even if you're an orphan.

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:09.750
High achievers are exempted from paying tuition,
and scholarships are also granted.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:12.670
But in exchange, competition is fierce,

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:14.920
making it all the more difficult
to pass the exams.

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:18.420
It's said that only one in ten students

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:20.420
make it to the graduation ceremony
held after five years.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:24.040
If you fail an exam just once,
then you're finished.

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:26.710
Your path to becoming
an alchemist is cut off.

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:28.920
Since being admitted here,

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:33.420
my life has been nothing but
studying, training, experiments,

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:37.290
and part-time jobs to pay for
my living expenses.

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:41.580
I hadn't been able to make
any friends at all...

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:45.750
The most I ever really did was talk to
the lady who runs the school store.

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:48.080
Of course, that's my own doing.

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:49.210
Still...

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:53.460
It's not like I need to meet
all sorts of people...

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:09.830
After all, there was a single encounter
that had a big influence on me.

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:14.330
And then, five years passed by in a flash.

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:18.290
It's finally time for the graduation exam!

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:19.540
We've got to give it our all!

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:20.540
It's time...!

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:22.630
The day has finally come!

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:25.710
That should do it...

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:28.380
Master! Ms. Maria!

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:29.420
Sarasa?

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:31.960
What is it?
Your exam's tomorrow, isn't it?

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:34.130
Well, I just happened to be passing by...

00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:35.540
So, well...

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:38.830
To think, it's been five years now
since I took you on as an apprentice...

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:41.000
I've come a long way, haven't I?

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.210
Even so...

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:44.920
Don't underestimate the graduation exam.

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:47.000
Hurry up and get to bed
rather than dawdling around.

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:49.210
Er, well...

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:52.460
She came here to see you.

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:54.130
Huh? Is that so?

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:57.130
Ah, no, I mean...

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:59.040
I-I'll be off...

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:00.000
Hold on.

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:03.290
It would be downright ridiculous
if you slipped up

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:04.880
because you couldn't see past your hair.

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:06.710
Sorry to trouble you.

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:08.040
You've got nothing to worry about.

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:11.750
You're the apprentice of
Ophelia Millis, aren't you?

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:15.380
There, all done.

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:17.210
Thank you, Ms. Maria!

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:18.250
Sarasa...

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.210
Give it your all!

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:21.580
Right!

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:25.750
We shall now begin the written exam.

00:07:33.170 --> 00:07:36.210
Good work on the written exam, all of you.

00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:38.580
All that remains is the practical exam.

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:41.960
We will not be answering
any questions during the exam.

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:45.920
Regardless of whatever issues may arise,
you are to resolve them on your own.

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:50.580
My past five years of effort
are riding on this practical exam...!

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:52.750
But I can handle it!

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:57.250
I messed up...

00:07:58.630 --> 00:08:00.750
I'm done for... My life is over... It's all over...

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:03.130
Next up, we have Sarasa Feed.
I'm done for... My life is over... It's all over...<b></b>

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:04.210
Coming!

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:11.670
We shall now begin the practical exam.

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:16.630
Please create an intermediate level potion
using the basic recipe.

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:18.420
You may begin!

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:26.290
I've helped my master prepare
intermediate level potions countless times!

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:27.960
This will be easy!

00:08:28.210 --> 00:08:30.130
For an intermediate level, I'll need...

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:31.750
A cepharantha bulb!

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:33.500
Perenalcone sap!

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:36.170
And there it is! Filipendula!

00:08:36.710 --> 00:08:38.330
Ah, that was a close one...

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:39.790
This is dryas...

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:43.500
It's similar to filipendula,
but that's not enough to trip me up!

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:45.830
Master chewed me out about it
all those times, after all...

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:49.420
Now then, where's the real filipendula...

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:50.290
Huh?

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:53.040
Filipendula... Filipendula...

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:54.830
There isn't any?!

00:08:55.830 --> 00:08:59.750
Regardless of whatever issues may arise,
you are to resolve them on your own.

00:09:00.710 --> 00:09:02.750
It's a trick question?

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:05.960
There are numerous other
combinations for making potions...

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:08.830
In that case, the handout from before
may have been a trick,

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:12.170
and they're actually testing
if I know those other recipes.

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:13.500
That must be it!

00:09:13.710 --> 00:09:16.630
For another recipe to prepare
an intermediate level potion,

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:19.580
I'd need woostail and lyratam fruit...

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:21.790
None of those either?!
What's going on?!

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:29.500
Ah, no, I've got to think this through logically!

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:31.750
This is a test to make a potion,

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:34.710
so they wouldn't want me
to make anything else...

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.420
Stay calm...

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:39.460
I can't let these last five years go to waste.

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:42.000
Potion... I need a potion...

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:47.000
Listen, don't go mixing up
dryas and filipendula.

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:49.130
Otherwise, you'll just waste ingredients.

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:52.210
Master, I understand that
they're easy to mix up,

00:09:52.210 --> 00:09:54.880
but are there any uses for dryas?

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:58.000
You can technically use it
to make a high level potion...

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.790
That's amazing!

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:02.500
The trouble is, it's real tricky to handle.

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:06.380
Not only is it difficult to use,
but you also need a ton of magical power.

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:09.670
Normally it would be a lot easier
to just go with a different recipe,

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:11.420
and you'd end up with less mistakes.

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:12.210
However...

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:13.000
However?

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:15.920
I could see it being useful for you.

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:18.460
Useful for you...

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:21.750
A recipe for a high level potion...!

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:25.170
From the prepared ingredients,
I'll need apifilliam roots!

00:10:25.380 --> 00:10:26.790
Armelina fruits!

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:29.290
And then, dryas!

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:43.540
First, you add the finely chopped dryas
to the alchemic cauldron.

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:46.290
Then, you stir it while
adding in magical power...

00:10:47.630 --> 00:10:51.330
You need a lot of magical power,
till it starts giving off light.

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.170
Not yet! Not yet!

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:02.080
Once it's glowing, you add the apifilliam,
then just keep on stirring

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:04.380
until it turns clear.

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:06.290
Then you add in the armelina,

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:08.790
and pour in even more magical power!

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:11.630
What?!

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:12.460
What's going on?!

00:11:17.210 --> 00:11:19.080
And then, you're done!

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:37.130
I never expected to have to make
a high level potion.

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:40.130
I guess I should have expected as much
from the graduation exam...

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:43.580
It certainly is a high level potion.

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:47.420
Still, why go out of her way to perform
such difficult alchemy...?

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:48.670
Oh no!

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:50.330
Hmm?

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:52.210
You mixed up the prepared ingredients?!

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:53.790
That's not good!

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:56.040
My apologies!
That was entirely my mistake!

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:58.540
I'll hurry and summon that student back
so she can redo her exam!

00:11:58.540 --> 00:11:59.540
Hold on.

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:00.380
Huh?

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:02.540
She performed her alchemy properly.

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:05.170
Besides, if that information is made public,

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:07.630
it will damage our instution's reputation.

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:10.920
We didn't make any mistakes here...
Understood?

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:11.920
R-right...

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:15.790
Still, to think she could make something
like this out of such ingredients!

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.830
What incredible talent!

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:23.460
Congratulations!

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:24.630
Thank goodness!

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:26.630
We did it! Friends for life!

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:28.670
Let's head to the graduation party!

00:12:28.670 --> 00:12:29.920
Yeah, let's go!

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:35.170
This is my alchemize license...

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:40.000
I'm an alchemist...!

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:44.250
I didn't really make any friends
these last five years,

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:46.880
and didn't make much in the way of
memories beside studying...

00:12:47.210 --> 00:12:49.130
Still, there were some fun times too,

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:52.080
and it wasn't such a bad
school life in the end!

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:57.130
From here on out,
I've got to make it on my own...!

00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:12.540
Hello!

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:15.500
My, it seems we have a visit
from an alchemist.

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:16.210
Yeah!

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:18.040
Starting today, I'm an alchemist!

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:19.040
Congratulations.

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:20.630
Thank you!

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:22.170
Um...

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:25.250
If you're looking for Ophelia,
she's back in the workshop.

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:27.500
Master!

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:33.250
Ah, Sarasa, congrats.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:35.040
It's all thanks to you!

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:39.080
I heard how you scored top on the exam.

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:40.000
Huh?

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:44.080
I received a reward for the exam,
but I didn't place first.

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:46.880
There are always people who
come in ahead of me...

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:48.630
But they're all nobles, right?

00:13:48.630 --> 00:13:52.170
Their grades get a boost based on their titles.

00:13:52.170 --> 00:13:54.210
Oh, is that so?

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:57.080
More importantly, I have a request, Master!

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:58.830
Hmm? What is it?

00:13:58.830 --> 00:13:59.750
Well...

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:02.380
I want to go purchase
my complete alchemy works!

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:07.290
Master, what's the first thing I'll need
after becoming an alchemist?

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:10.790
Well, that'd be a complete alchemy works.

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:13.330
All the alchemy techniques
are recorded there,

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:15.630
from introductory level to advanced.

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:17.330
That sounds amazing...

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:20.290
They should sell them at the
academy too, for 7,500,000 rhea.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.580
S-seven million...?!

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:25.630
But if you go through me,
you can get it for 5,000,000 instead.

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:29.080
If you save up until graduation,
you should be able to afford it.

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:30.830
Five million...

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:34.500
After all, I've managed to save up enough!
All five million!

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:36.750
You really did...

00:14:37.630 --> 00:14:40.170
What do you say?
Why not work at under me?

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:41.960
Huh? B-but...

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:46.130
If I studied under an alchemist
on Master's level,

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:49.630
I would definitely be able to
live up to my full potential...

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:52.960
Ah, thank you, but no!

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:54.670
I've got to strike out on my own!

00:14:54.670 --> 00:14:56.790
I can't stay ignorant to
the ways of the world!

00:14:56.790 --> 00:15:01.130
It's a shame, but going out into the world
should be a good experience for you.

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:03.540
With that in mind,
here's a graduation present for you!

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:04.380
Huh?

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:05.670
Wow...

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:08.000
It's so cute!

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:10.460
I bestowed all sorts of effects on it,

00:15:10.460 --> 00:15:12.920
like expanded storage, weight reduction,
and theft protection.

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:14.420
Huh? Is it really alright for me to have it?

00:15:14.420 --> 00:15:15.920
Isn't it really expensive?

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:17.130
Don't worry about it.

00:15:17.130 --> 00:15:21.130
Just like your necklace there,
it's something I made personally.

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:22.880
Thank you!

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:26.130
Now you'll be able to take the complete
works with you on your trip, right?

00:15:26.130 --> 00:15:27.210
Huh?

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:30.460
S-so this is the complete works...

00:15:30.710 --> 00:15:33.130
It's super thick, isn't it?!

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:37.080
Volumes one and two that you used
around the shop are the thinnest.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:39.750
They get thicker as you go along.

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:42.290
So heavy...

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:45.540
Sarasa, you said you don't need
them guaranteed, didn't you?

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:49.420
Ah, that's right! That's why
I brought my master along!

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:51.460
Master, could you please check them?!

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:54.210
I don't think it's anything to get
so worked up over...

00:15:57.580 --> 00:16:01.540
This is the first time we've ever had
a master class alchemist come and

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:03.170
give a check so casually.

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:06.630
Still, you sure did work hard.

00:16:06.630 --> 00:16:10.080
Most fresh graduates only buy
up till volume three.

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:12.210
It's cheaper that way.

00:16:13.210 --> 00:16:16.000
It's all thanks to my master.

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:18.790
All done! That will be five million rhea!

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:19.750
R-right.

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:23.500
W-well then, I'd like to
complete the purchase!

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:24.750
Thanks for the business!

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:25.750
So quick!

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:28.630
There!

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:29.880
Wow, so light!

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.420
That's my master's work for you!

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:32.500
Sarasa.

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:35.130
Congrats on your graduation.

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:37.460
Come back sometime
if you get the chance, okay?

00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:39.710
Right! Thanks for everything!

00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:44.670
Hey, isn't that Ophelia Millis?

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:48.580
No way! So the rumors about that girl
being her apprentice were true?

00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:51.000
I should've made friends with her!

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:53.040
Master, I'll be fine.

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:54.960
I can handle looking for
a place to train on my own...

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:57.170
I'm already here, so let me help
pick out a good one.

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:01.210
Hello!

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:05.920
HELLO!

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:07.710
Welcome!

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:09.750
You're...!

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:13.080
What are you looking for today?

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:17.380
Well, I'm looking for a place to train,
so could I see who's recruiting?

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:20.130
Understood. Hold on just a moment.

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:21.960
There aren't many people around today...

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:23.830
That's because of the graduation ceremony.

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:26.130
Everyone is busy celebrating!

00:17:26.130 --> 00:17:31.380
I see! I had a party with friends
after mine too.

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:33.210
What about you, Sarasa...?

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:37.000
I-I don't have any interest
in stuff like that.

00:17:37.920 --> 00:17:39.210
Don't get all down.

00:17:39.210 --> 00:17:41.500
We'll have a graduation party
for you at our place later.

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:45.170
I'm not down!

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:47.080
Here. Thank you for waiting.

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:48.880
Ah, thank you.

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:54.670
Sorry, but could you show us
the shop vacancies too?

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:55.670
Huh?

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:57.920
Are you planning on opening
a branch location, Master?

00:17:57.920 --> 00:18:00.290
No, that's not it...

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:02.170
Did you find any good fits?

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:05.330
Not yet...

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:08.960
How much money do you
have left for job hunting?

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:14.670
Pretty much nothing, after buying
the complete alchemy works...

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:16.330
In that case,

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:18.040
I have a recommendation!

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:23.000
This is previously owned property
from alchemists for sale?

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:24.500
This one here.

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:26.250
Huh...?

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:28.500
10,000 rhea?! So cheap!

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.670
The storefront is a bit small,

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:33.540
but it has living space and
fields for medicinal herbs,

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:35.540
and comes furnished
and equipped with tools.

00:18:35.540 --> 00:18:38.080
It may be a bit small,
but it's quite the bargain.

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:39.580
It's way too cheap...

00:18:39.920 --> 00:18:42.460
Wait, are you telling me to open a shop?!

00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:44.750
I only just graduated today!

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:48.290
I figure it's so cheap because
the nation is providing a subsidy.

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:52.170
Yes, since they want alchemists
out in the country as well.

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:56.830
So it's so far out in the middle of nowhere
that they're willing to subsidize it

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:59.460
to the point where it can be
sold for 10,000 rhea?

00:18:59.460 --> 00:19:04.540
Yes, it's a small town surrounded by forest
at the base of the Gelba Rohha mountains.

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:06.040
Actually, it's more of a village.

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:08.170
The Gelba Rohha mountains...

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:10.750
It takes a month to get there by carriage
from the capital, doesn't it?!

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:14.830
Yeah. But it's easy to get ahold of
alchemy ingredients around there,

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:17.540
so it's not a half bad place
to polish your craft.

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:21.460
But well, you may not get many customers,
since it's out in the country.

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:22.250
Hey!

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:25.170
Isn't that a fatal flaw when
trying to run a shop?!

00:19:25.170 --> 00:19:26.540
But it's a great spot...

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:30.040
Besides, I don't know the first thing
about running a business!

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:31.500
That won't be an issue.

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:34.750
You can already make things up through
the second volume of the complete works.

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:35.580
Huh?!

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:39.080
W-well, it's true that I've made
a good variety of things, but still...

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:40.670
I forgot to mention it,

00:19:40.670 --> 00:19:45.040
but the way to make frequently used artifacts
is also written out in volumes one and two.

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:48.540
And so, you should be plenty capable
of running a store as you are now!

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:54.210
But I just spent all of my savings...

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:56.540
I may be able to get ahold of
ingredients cheaply,

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:59.290
but if I can't sell my products,
I won't be able to make a living.

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:02.080
Alright, then how about this?

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:07.460
I'll regularly purchase any
rare ingredients you find in the area.

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:10.460
You shouldn't have any trouble
making a living, then.

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:14.080
In that case, I could at least
earn enough to get by.

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:16.250
And when I consider my training...

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:19.790
Wait, Master, were you just
after those ingredients?

00:20:20.540 --> 00:20:24.130
I'm always considering
my apprentice's future, you know.

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:26.540
You didn't deny it there, did you?

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:29.920
This is the title deed.
Please, sign here.

00:20:29.920 --> 00:20:30.960
Yes, of course.

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:32.380
Hey, Master!

00:20:32.380 --> 00:20:33.540
This is too sudden!

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:35.290
Huh?!

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:37.130
Here's the key to your shop.

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:39.000
My gift to you.

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:40.920
And the deed, too.

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:45.040
Now you're a proper alchemist
with your own shop!

00:20:45.040 --> 00:20:46.790
No way! It's impossible!

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:49.250
I'll lend you a hand,
so just give it your all.

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:53.000
Even if it doesn't work and you have to
come back, I'll hire you on then.

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.500
But it will go fine!

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:57.420
We're talking about a shop run by
Ophelia Millis's apprentice, here!

00:20:58.290 --> 00:21:00.750
My own shop...

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:11.500
Got it! I'll give it my all!

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:13.710
I'll try running my own shop!

00:21:14.170 --> 00:21:15.380
Sarasa...

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:16.880
That's the spirit!

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:17.920
Right!

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:23.040
Cheers, to Sarasa's graduation!

00:21:25.080 --> 00:21:29.130
Master, you can become a high rank alchemist
by mastering through volume nine

00:21:29.130 --> 00:21:31.670
in the complete alchemy works
I purchased today, right?

00:21:31.670 --> 00:21:32.670
That's right.

00:21:32.670 --> 00:21:35.750
Then have you mastered all ten volumes?

00:21:36.630 --> 00:21:38.670
Only fools do that.

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:43.130
Most of the artifacts in volume ten
are just a pain to make.

00:21:43.130 --> 00:21:44.920
They're not worth the hassle.

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:49.830
But well, there is an important one in there
necessary for achieving master class...

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:53.250
Huh?! So what's the qualification
for becoming master class...?

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:54.580
That's a secret!

00:21:54.880 --> 00:21:58.500
Come on, what is it? Please tell me!

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:02.290
I'll tell you once it seems like you've got
the stuff to become a high rank alchemist.

00:22:03.540 --> 00:22:05.130
You promise, right?

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:08.210
Worry about whether or not
you can hit high rank first.

00:22:08.210 --> 00:22:09.540
Right...

00:22:12.420 --> 00:22:18.170
Master Ophelia, Ms. Maria,
thank you helping me out for so long!

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:20.670
Here's an assortment.

00:22:20.670 --> 00:22:24.920
It has all the basic tools and
business advice you'll need inside.

00:22:24.920 --> 00:22:29.040
Oh, my...
Thank you so much for everything.

00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:32.960
Despite appearances, she worries
quite a bit about you, Sarasa.

00:22:32.960 --> 00:22:34.790
You didn't need to tell her that...

00:22:34.790 --> 00:22:37.460
You just aren't honest enough.

00:22:37.460 --> 00:22:38.290
Quiet, you...!

00:22:47.210 --> 00:22:49.750
It's a lot earlier than I planned,

00:22:49.750 --> 00:22:54.170
but now I can fulfill my dream of
having a shop of my own...

00:22:55.710 --> 00:22:59.210
My days spent up until now have
all been leading up to this point.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:04.500
After a month long journey,
anticipation welling up inside of me...

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:06.790
I've finally made it here
to this brand new land!

00:23:07.580 --> 00:23:10.210
Finally, at last...!

00:23:12.250 --> 00:23:15.040
I have my own...

00:23:15.040 --> 00:23:16.710
shop?

00:23:18.750 --> 00:23:21.880
This is my shop?!

00:23:23.580 --> 00:23:24.880
It can't be...

00:23:30.750 --> 00:23:34.330
This is just too much!

00:23:35.960 --> 00:23:40.380
<b>Complete Alchemy Works:</b>

00:23:35.960 --> 00:23:40.380
<b>Deed to the Shop:</b>

00:23:35.960 --> 00:23:40.380
<b>Travel Expenses to the Village:</b>
